OL,3,GNEWSAPlans unveiled to rebuild cafe
OL,4,Adestroyed by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to rebuild a popular biker cafe
OL,7,Fhave been submitted, four months after
OL,8,Fit was destroyed by fire.
OL,10,FThe View Coffee Shop in Milton Abbas,
OL,11,FDorset, went up in flames in the early
OL,12,Fhours of 27 June and the neighbouring
OL,13,Fsports pavilion was also badly damaged.
OL,15,FHayley Bridge, who opened the cafe in
OL,16,F2023, was given the go-ahead in August
OL,17,Fto start clearing up the site while the
OL,18,Finsurance process continued.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
